00:19:29.170 --> 00:19:31.420
Pakaian Dewa legendaris .

00:19:32.460 --> 00:19:33.730
Tuhan Cloth .

00:19:35.310 --> 00:19:37.470
Tidak hanya kita mampu menyeberangi dimensi ...

